    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet in the sought-after area of Knockaverry, this beautifully presented five bedroom dormer bungalow enjoys a spectacular sea-facing rear garden with uninterrupted views towards Capel Island, offering the perfect blend of modern family living and scenic surroundings.\n\nBuilt in 2008 and extended in 2014, the property was thoughtfully transformed into a spacious dormer bungalow, adding two generous first-floor bedrooms with views of the sea to the rear while enhancing the home's overall layout and functionality.\n\nAt the heart of the home is a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, designed for modern living and entertaining. Large French doors open directly onto a split-level deck, seamlessly connecting the indoor and outdoor spaces and making the most of the exceptional sea views.\n\nThe accommodation comprises of 5 bedrooms, including a spacious main bedroom with French doors opening onto the rear garden deck, allowing you to wake up to beautiful sea and Island views each morning.\n\nOutside, the property features a welcoming lawned front garden while the split-level rear garden has been carefully designed to maximise both privacy and the breathtaking outlook. The expansive deck provides an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing while taking in the ever-changing seascape. An oasis of tranquility awaits at the lower end of the split level garden which is a true highlight of the property, boasting an abundance of mature trees and thoughtfully planted shrubs. Lovingly maintained, they provide a beautiful tapestry of colour and texture creating a wonderfully private and peaceful setting.\n\nLocated just minutes from Youghal town and its many amenities, beaches and seaside walks, this impressive home offers a rare opportunity to enjoy contemporary living in one of East Cork's most picturesque coastal settings."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
