        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nKitchen - 4.04 x 3.52\nFully fitted kitchen. Tiled floor. White goods included.\n\nDining / living - 6.73 x 4.42\nOpen fire place. Laminate floor. OFCH\n\nBathroom - 3.31 x 1.88\nTiled floor. Toilet, bath & sink.\n\nOffice - 3.19 x 2.24\nCould be used as a 5tth bedrooom. Laminate floor\n\nBed 1 - 4.10 x 3.39\n\n\nBed 2 - 4.15 x 3.48\nMain bedroom. Ensuite. Fitted wardrobes. French doors overlooking the views.\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBed 3 - 5.21 x 2.25\nCarpet floor. Fitted wardrobes. Velux windows.\n\nBed 4 - 5.22 x 4.80\nCarpet floor. Fitted wardrobes. Velux windows. Ensuite.\n\nEnsuite - 2.50 x 1.97\nFully tiled. Toilet, shower & sink.\n\nShower room. - \n\n\nHallway/ Storage area. - 5.22 x 3.67\n\n\n"
